PE 795: Alternating gcd sum / 交替GCD和

=== Alternating GCD sum for small N ===
  N= 1: S=     1
  N= 2: S=     1
  N= 3: S=     4
  N= 4: S=     8
  N= 5: S=    13
  N= 6: S=    17
  N= 7: S=    24
  N= 8: S=    40
  N= 9: S=    49
  N=10: S=    57

=== Simple GCD sum vs alternating ===
  N= 1: simple=       1  alt=     1
  N= 2: simple=       5  alt=     1
  N= 3: simple=      12  alt=     4
  N= 4: simple=      24  alt=     8
  N= 5: simple=      37  alt=    13
  N= 6: simple=      61  alt=    17
  N= 7: simple=      80  alt=    24
  N= 8: simple=     112  alt=    40

=== Pillai function P(n) = Σ_{k=1}^n gcd(k,n) ===
  P( 1) = 1  P( 2) = 3  P( 3) = 5  P( 4) = 8  P( 5) = 9
  P( 6) = 15  P( 7) = 13  P( 8) = 20  P( 9) = 21  P(10) = 27
  P(11) = 21  P(12) = 40  P(13) = 25  P(14) = 39  P(15) = 45
  P(16) = 48  P(17) = 33  P(18) = 63  P(19) = 37  P(20) = 72


=== Alternating pillai sum ===
  N= 1: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =        1
  N= 2: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =       -2
  N= 3: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =        3
  N= 4: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =       -5
  N= 5: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =        4
  N= 6: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =      -11
  N= 7: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =        2
  N= 8: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =      -18
  N= 9: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =        3
  N=10: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =      -24
  N=11: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =       -3
  N=12: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =      -43
  N=13: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =      -18
  N=14: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =      -57
  N=15: Σ(-1)^n P(n) =      -12

=== Half-alternating (only alternating over i) ===
  N= 1: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = 1
  N= 2: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = -1
  N= 3: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = 4
  N= 4: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = -4
  N= 5: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = 5
  N= 6: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = -9
  N= 7: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = 4
  N= 8: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = -20
  N= 9: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = 1
  N=10: Σ_i (-1)^i Σ_j gcd(i,j) = -25
